      <h1 class="ed-title">AC vs DC Treadmill Motor</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Almost every home treadmill runs on a DC motor and almost every gym treadmill runs on AC. That split is not a quality ranking — it is two answers to two different jobs, and for most households the question that matters is not which type but how much motor.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
